B.aj7=new A.ac("C.O.R.E. skill check: choose the five elements that structure productive iteration.",B.JB,"Teach iteration as C.O.R.E. diffs: change one layer per pass, measure the delta.","Positioning: PASS1 breadth; PASS2 7-day outcome; PASS3 proof placeholders; <=12 words; ban revolutionary.","You iterate like a pro: each pass edits on purpose, not by vibe.","Run three labeled passes to refine a positioning line for an AI inbox assistant for founders. Pass 1 generates three broad options. Pass 2 sharpens the strongest option around a concrete seven-day user outcome. Pass 3 adds proof hooks using placeholders [Customer type] and [Metric], marking unknown measurements as [Unknown]. Keep each final line at most twelve words and ban the word \u201crevolutionary.\u201d")
B.a80=new A.k("What Made This Work","Each pass had a job: explore, sharpen outcome, attach honest proof hooks.\n- Context named crowded category\n- Objective evolved line-by-line instead of rewriting randomly\n- Requirements enforced word cap and banned clich\xe9s\n- Expectations labeled passes for reuse as a template")
B.a81=new A.k("Weak vs Strong Prompt","Weak prompt:\nImprove this tagline\n\nStrong prompt:\n3-pass iteration; breadth then 7-day outcome then proof placeholders; <=12 words; ban revolutionary.")
B.aaz=new A.k("C.O.R.E. Breakdown","C - Context\nFounders; noisy inbox category\n\nO - Objective\nSharper positioning each pass\n\nR - Requirements\nWord limits; proof placeholders; honesty\n\nE - Expectations\nLabeled passes")
B.Io=s([B.a80,B.a81,B.aaz],t.c)
B.ad7=new A.ab("Three passes on a positioning line","First drafts sound like category clich\xe9s.\n\nIteration prompts must change specific C.O.R.E. slots each pass.\n\nTo get a usable result, your prompt must define:\n- Context - product and crowded category\n- Objective - tighten positioning across iterations\n- Requirements - pass 1 breadth, pass 2 specificity, pass 3 proof hooks; each <=12 words\n- Expectations - label passes clearly","Iterate a positioning line for \u201cAI inbox assistant for founders.\u201d\n\nPass 1: creative breadth (3 options).\nPass 2: rewrite best option with sharper Objective (what outcome in 7 days).\nPass 3: add proof hook placeholders [Metric], [Customer type] without inventing numbers\u2014use [Unknown] if needed.\n\nRequirements: each final line <=12 words; ban \u201crevolutionary.\u201d\n\nExpectations: label PASS1/PASS2/PASS3.","PASS1\n1) Your inbox, summarized\n2) Founder inbox autopilot\n3) AI turns email into tasks\n\nPASS2\nTurns inbox noise into a daily priority list in 7 days\n\nPASS3\nCuts daily inbox time for [Customer type]\u2014target save [Unknown] minutes; measured via [Metric]\n\nIteration works when each pass edits a named C.O.R.E. dimension.","Iteration prompts name which C.O.R.E. layer changes next.","If every pass changes everything, you are not iterating\u2014you are dice-rolling.",B.aj7,B.Io)
