B.aj0=new A.ac("Choose the five prompt elements that expand a note into a useful paragraph without inventing details.",B.MG,"This is where most AI users get burned: expansion invites invention. Your prompt must prohibit new facts and cap length.","Expand this note into one paragraph (70\u201390 words). Preserve meaning. Add only clarifying context\u2014no new facts/dates/causes/promises. Professional tone. Return only the paragraph.","You\u2019re now expanding content without hallucinated details\u2014this is a real professional advantage.","Expand into one professional paragraph (70\u201390 words). Preserve meaning. Add only clarifying context. Do not add new facts, dates, causes, or promises. Return only the paragraph.")
B.ab9=new A.k("What Made This Work","The control point is *safe expansion*.\n- Requirements banned new facts and promises\n- Expectations set a tight word window to keep it useful (not endless)\n- Objective made the paragraph readable without changing the underlying claim")
B.a8Y=new A.k("Weak vs Strong Prompt","Weak prompt:\nTurn this into a paragraph\n\nStrong prompt:\nExpand into one paragraph (70\u201390 words). Preserve meaning. Add only clarifying context; no new facts/dates/causes/promises. Professional tone. Return only the paragraph.")
B.a9t=new A.k("C.O.R.E. Breakdown","C - Context\nShort note needs to become stakeholder-readable\n\nO - Objective\nAdd context without inventing reality\n\nR - Requirements\nPreserve meaning; no new facts/dates/causes/promises; clarifying context only\n\nE - Expectations\nOne paragraph, 70\u201390 words, output only")
B.Lk=s([B.ab9,B.a8Y,B.a9t],t.c)
B.adD=new A.ab("Expand a Short Note Into a Full Paragraph","You have a short note that needs to become a usable paragraph for a stakeholder update.\n\nIf you expand too freely, you introduce details you can\u2019t defend.\n\nIf you expand too conservatively, the paragraph still doesn\u2019t help anyone.\n\nTo get a usable result, your prompt must define:\n- Context - expansion for stakeholder readability\n- Objective - add context without inventing facts\n- Requirements - stay within provided information; add only clarifying context; keep tone professional\n- Expectations - one paragraph, specific length constraint","Expand the note into one paragraph.\n\nRequirements:\n- Keep the meaning the same\n- Add only clarifying context (no new facts, dates, causes, or promises)\n- Keep it professional and concrete\n- Target 70\u201390 words\n\nReturn only the paragraph.","The team is making steady progress on the project and is currently focused on completing the remaining work needed for the next milestone. We\u2019re validating the latest changes to ensure the outcome is stable and ready for review. Once validation is complete, we\u2019ll share the updated package and confirm the next steps based on the confirmed results.\n\nNotice how the word limit and \u201cno new facts\u201d rule prevents the model from filling gaps with confident-sounding fiction.","Expanding safely requires tighter rules than summarising.","Expansion is where hallucination hides. If you don\u2019t ban new facts, the model will \u201chelp\u201d by making your paragraph sound more complete than your inputs.",B.aj0,B.Lk)
