B.ahw=new A.ac("Choose the five prompt elements that produce a dashboard-safe one-sentence status signal.",B.L5,"Dashboards are where \u201cslight\u201d drift becomes a decision error. Lock sentence count and ban certainty inflation.","Rewrite as exactly one sentence. Preserve meaning. Facts only; no new info. Plain neutral tone; avoid hype and certainty inflation. Return only the sentence.","You now control status signals that people can safely act on\u2014most users accidentally publish overconfidence.","Rewrite the update as exactly one sentence. Preserve meaning. Facts only\u2014do not add new information. Plain neutral tone. Avoid hype or certainty inflation. Return only the sentence.")
B.aaI=new A.k("What Made This Work","The control point is *signal integrity*.\n- Expectations forced exactly one sentence\n- Requirements banned new info and hype\n- Objective kept it dashboard-safe: accurate, neutral, and quoteable")
B.a94=new A.k("Weak vs Strong Prompt","Weak prompt:\nMake this a one-line update\n\nStrong prompt:\nExactly one sentence. Preserve meaning. Facts only\u2014no new info. Plain neutral tone; avoid hype or certainty inflation. Return only the sentence.")
B.aaN=new A.k("C.O.R.E. Breakdown","C - Context\nDashboard one-liner that becomes a decision signal\n\nO - Objective\nAccurate, neutral summary without hype\n\nR - Requirements\nFacts only; preserve intent; no certainty inflation\n\nE - Expectations\nExactly one sentence, output only")
B.Ki=s([B.aaI,B.a94,B.aaN],t.c)
B.ae8=new A.ab("Turn a Status Update Into a One-Sentence Summary","You need a one-sentence status line for a dashboard.\n\nDashboards punish ambiguity: one wrong sentence becomes a false signal.\n\nIf you overstate progress, leadership thinks risk is gone.\n\nIf you understate it, teams overreact.\n\nTo get a usable result, your prompt must define:\n- Context - dashboard one-liner\n- Objective - accurate signal without hype\n- Requirements - facts only; preserve intent; no invented confidence\n- Expectations - exactly one sentence, plain tone","Rewrite the status update as exactly one sentence.\n\nRequirements:\n- Preserve meaning\n- Facts only; do not add new information\n- Keep tone plain and neutral\n- Avoid hype or certainty inflation\n\nReturn only the sentence.","Testing is nearly complete, and we remain on track for Thursday's release based on current confirmed progress.\n\nWhat matters here is signal integrity: the prompt prevents \u201cconfident rewriting\u201d that quietly upgrades certainty.","One sentence can\u2019t carry nuance, so your constraints must.","Dashboards amplify errors. If you don\u2019t prohibit certainty inflation, the model will turn \u201cnearly complete\u201d into \u201cdone\u201d in spirit\u2014and people will plan off it.",B.ahw,B.Ki)
B.a3J=new A.b("Set structure: 3\u20134 sentences (20\u201330 seconds)",!0)
B.VD=new A.b("Preserve meaning of all points",!0)
B.Zq=new A.b("Natural but professional tone",!0)
B.ZH=new A.b("Ban new facts or promises",!0)
B.Sr=new A.b("Return only the script",!0)
B.a4c=new A.b("Add extra examples to make it engaging",!1)
B.a_8=new A.b("Invent a story to make it memorable",!1)
