B.aiX=new A.ac("Choose the five prompt elements that produce a natural spoken script without introducing new claims.",B.LX,"In a live script, any invented detail becomes your responsibility. Lock facts, cap length, and ban new promises.","Rewrite as a spoken script: 3\u20134 sentences (20\u201330 seconds). Preserve meaning. Natural but professional tone. No new facts or promises. Return only the script.","You now get speakable scripts that don\u2019t create new liabilities\u2014most users can\u2019t stop the model from \u201cadding.\u201d","Rewrite the points as a short spoken script (3\u20134 sentences, ~20\u201330 seconds). Preserve meaning of all points. Keep tone natural but professional. Do not add new facts or promises. Return only the script.")
B.ack=new A.k("What Made This Work","The control point is *spoken naturalness without invention*.\n- Expectations set a delivery window (20\u201330 seconds)\n- Requirements banned new facts/promises\n- Objective kept credibility: natural tone, professional boundaries")
B.acl=new A.k("Weak vs Strong Prompt","Weak prompt:\nTurn this into a script\n\nStrong prompt:\nRewrite as a spoken script: 3\u20134 sentences (20\u201330 seconds). Preserve meaning. Natural but professional tone. No new facts/promises. Return only the script.")
B.aaC=new A.k("C.O.R.E. Breakdown","C - Context\nLive delivery where you must defend every claim\n\nO - Objective\nNatural script that stays true to the inputs\n\nR - Requirements\nPreserve points; no invention; professional boundaries\n\nE - Expectations\n3\u20134 sentences, 20\u201330 seconds, output only")
B.NE=s([B.ack,B.acl,B.aaC],t.c)
B.aex=new A.ab("Turn a List of Points Into a Short Script","You need to speak these points in a live setting.\n\nIf the script is too stiff, you sound robotic.\n\nIf it\u2019s too casual, you lose credibility.\n\nIf it invents details, you can\u2019t defend them on the spot.\n\nTo get a usable result, your prompt must define:\n- Context - spoken delivery under scrutiny\n- Objective - natural script that stays true\n- Requirements - no invention; keep key points; professional tone\n- Expectations - 20\u201330 seconds, 3\u20134 sentences","Rewrite the points as a short spoken script.\n\nRequirements:\n- 3\u20134 sentences (20\u201330 seconds spoken)\n- Preserve meaning of all points\n- Keep tone natural but professional\n- Do not add new facts or promises\n\nReturn only the script.","We've completed initial testing and things look stable so far. The team is preparing the final changes for review, and we\u2019ll share the updated package on Thursday. If anything in validation changes that picture, we\u2019ll flag it immediately.\n\nNotice how the prompt prevents stage-fright hallucination: it bans invention while still allowing a natural spoken rhythm.","Natural tone is safe only when facts are locked.","Live scripts are where invented details blow up. If you don\u2019t ban invention, the model will add \u201csmooth transitions\u201d that become new claims you have to defend.",B.aiX,B.NE)
B.Ka=s([B.ad8,B.ae8,B.aex],t.r)
B.Hw=new A.bR("Repurpose Content for New Formats",B.Ka,u.k)
